         The engine fetches misaki's two pinned dictionaries into the shared audio folder on first Kokoro load,
         beside cmudict. No source change needed here: this extension reaches Kokoro only through the engine's
         speech service. Verified hartsyinference and hartsyinference.voice are both indexed on nuget.org at
         this version before bumping.
